      "value": "The following canny article mentions that a similar component, the \"Audio Reverb filter\", is not working as well, and shows a way to solve  the problem.\n( https://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/audio-reverb-filter-doesnt-work-when-it-is-added-to-reference-camera-in-sdk3 )\nIf you do the same operation, this problem may be solved as well.",
